  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Price just reduced.\r\n\r\nAfter 60-plus years, the family bid a fond farewell to 7 Sudeley St, Orakei. Consider it as a blank canvas or a substantial renovation? Longevity of tenure is a clear signal to the market of the quality of this location. Now zoned for terrace and apartment zoning, the development options are very broad and flexible. The site is almost the highest point in this part of Orakei, offering the opportunity for extensive views over Auckland. Potential purchasers should be thorough in doing their due diligence, as these opportunities seldom present themselves.\r\n\r\nView by appointment.",
